[{"answer":"On New Year's Day people start a new year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Many people make resolutions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/2.mp3"},{"answer":"They resolve to be better people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people decide that they will lose weight so that they can be healthier.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people decide to give up smoking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/5.mp3"},{"answer":"They also want to be healthier.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/6.mp3"},{"answer":"There are all kinds of resolutions that people make.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people try not to lose their tempers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people say that they will work harder.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/9.mp3"},{"answer":"There are people who try to give up bad habits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Every year, my brother says that he will stop biting his nails.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/11.mp3"},{"answer":"He stops biting his nails in January,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but by February he always starts again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/13.mp3"},{"answer":"That is the thing about New Year's resolutions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/14.mp3"},{"answer":"People seldom keep them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Everybody starts out with good intentions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/16.mp3"},{"answer":"but it is very hard to stick with them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't make New Year's resolutions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I find that I just break them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I just work day by day to break my bad habits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I know that I eat too many sweets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Every day, I just try to resist them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that every day is a new day regardless of whether it is New Year's Day or not.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Bad habits are hard to break.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/24.mp3"},{"answer":"The best thing is never to start any bad habits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know if my brother will ever stop biting his nails,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/26.mp3"},{"answer":"but I know that each January he intends to stop.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe one of these New Year's Days he'll get over that habit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/104-new-years-day-2019-04-07-03-55-23/28.mp3"}]
